Local: http://localhost:5678/webhook/cooja-logs
Cloud (hedef): https://senin-adin.app.n8n.cloud/webhook/cooja-logs

Node 2 — Code in JavaScript (Log Parser)
javascriptconst line = $json.log_line;
const timeMatch = line.match(/^(\d+)/);
const idMatch = line.match(/ID:(\d+)/);
const msg = line.replace(/^\d+\s+ID:\d+\s*/, '').trim();

let eventType = 'NORMAL';
if (msg.includes('Not reachable yet')) eventType = 'ROUTING_FAILURE';
else if (msg.includes('Waiting for prefix')) eventType = 'INITIALIZATION';
else if (msg.includes('parent switch')) eventType = 'TOPOLOGY_CHANGE';
else if (msg.includes('failed') || msg.includes('ERROR')) eventType = 'NODE_FAILURE';

return [{
  json: {
    timestamp: timeMatch ? timeMatch[1] : '0',
    node_id: idMatch ? idMatch[1] : 'unknown',
    message: msg,
    event_type: eventType,
    raw_line: line
  }
}];
Node 3 — Memory Manager (Code Node)
n8n'in $getWorkflowStaticData('global') ile kalıcı state yönetimi. Her node için health score (0-100) ve son 5 event geçmişi tutuluyor. Bu gerçek "agentic memory" — LLM tek logu değil temporal pattern'i görüyor:
javascriptconst staticData = $getWorkflowStaticData('global');

if (!staticData.nodeHistory) staticData.nodeHistory = {};
if (!staticData.healthScores) staticData.healthScores = {};

const nodeId = $json.node_id;

if (!staticData.healthScores[nodeId]) staticData.healthScores[nodeId] = 100;

const score = staticData.healthScores[nodeId];
if ($json.event_type === 'NODE_FAILURE')    staticData.healthScores[nodeId] = Math.max(0, score - 30);
if ($json.event_type === 'ROUTING_FAILURE') staticData.healthScores[nodeId] = Math.max(0, score - 15);
if ($json.event_type === 'TOPOLOGY_CHANGE') staticData.healthScores[nodeId] = Math.max(0, score - 5);
if ($json.event_type === 'NORMAL')          staticData.healthScores[nodeId] = Math.min(100, score + 2);

if (!staticData.nodeHistory[nodeId]) staticData.nodeHistory[nodeId] = [];
staticData.nodeHistory[nodeId].push({
  event_type: $json.event_type,
  message: $json.message,
  timestamp: $json.timestamp
});
if (staticData.nodeHistory[nodeId].length > 5) staticData.nodeHistory[nodeId].shift();

const networkSummary = Object.entries(staticData.healthScores)
  .map(([id, s]) => `Node#${id}:${s}`)
  .join(', ');

return [{
  json: {
    ...$json,
    health_score: staticData.healthScores[nodeId],
    node_history: staticData.nodeHistory[nodeId],
    network_summary: networkSummary,
    history_context: staticData.nodeHistory[nodeId]
      .map(h => `${h.event_type}: ${h.message}`)
      .join(' | ')
  }
}];
Node 4 — Switch (Router)

Output 0 → NORMAL, INITIALIZATION → Rule Engine
Output 1 → ROUTING_FAILURE, TOPOLOGY_CHANGE, NODE_FAILURE → LLM

Node 5 — Rule Engine (Code Node)
javascriptconst { event_type, node_id, message } = $json;

const rules = {
  ROUTING_FAILURE: { severity: 'HIGH',     action: 'RPL routing tablosunu kontrol et, parent node\'u doğrula' },
  TOPOLOGY_CHANGE: { severity: 'MEDIUM',   action: 'Ağ kararlılığını izle, parent değişimlerini logla' },
  NODE_FAILURE:    { severity: 'CRITICAL', action: 'Acil müdahale gerekli, node\'u yeniden başlat' },
  INITIALIZATION:  { severity: 'LOW',      action: 'Node başlatılıyor, izlemeye devam et' },
  NORMAL:          { severity: 'LOW',      action: null }
};

const result = rules[event_type] || rules.NORMAL;

return [{
  json: {
    method: 'RULE_BASED',
    anomaly_detected: event_type !== 'NORMAL' && event_type !== 'INITIALIZATION',
    anomaly_type: event_type,
    severity: result.severity,
    affected_node: `Node #${node_id}`,
    suggested_action: result.action,
    explanation: `Kural eşleşmesi: ${event_type}`,
    original_message: message,
    health_score: $json.health_score,
    network_summary: $json.network_summary
  }
}];
Node 6 — HTTP Request (Groq LLM)

URL: https://api.groq.com/openai/v1/chat/completions
Model: llama-3.1-8b-instant
Authorization: Bearer token (Groq API key)

json{
